                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_189">Durham. Benedictine
                        cathedral priory of St Cuthbert. </orgName><p>On fol. 9r: "Venerabilis
                        magister monachus et professus dominus Iohannes Fysshburn quondam
                        cancellarius ecclesie cathedralis Dunelm. obiit pridie Idus maij anno domini
                        millesimo cccco xxxo quarto cuius anime etc."</p><p>Below: "Liber Iohannis
                        Hamsterly [over erasure] monachi Dunelm. Disce pati." So on fol. 10v, name
                        erased.</p><p>On fol. 11r: "Iste liber assignatur Almariolo noviciorum per
                        venerabilem patrem magistrum Hugonem priorem ecclesie cathedralis Dunelm.
                        [Hugh Whitehaed, prior 1519--1540]".</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Given to Jesus Coll. by Mr. Man.</provenance>
